tic\",\"The complete R0 mouth waits beyond the seam with R1 rain visible before cut to black\",\"Underground portal texture only\",\"5\",\"Live view or destination composite\",\"Crying frame; R1 rain plate; granite seam\",\"poc_required\""},{"path":".studio/internal/production/camera-paths.csv","content":"path_id,shot_id,tool,duration_seconds,fps,start_state,end_state,notes\n\"PATH-001\",\"S01-001\",\"Numerical gameplay camera; exact tool pending CAM-001\",\"6\",\"24\",\"MP local (-4,2.6,-8), 62-degree FOV, ridge before hero enters\",\"Same camera after slow settle on hero/smoke\",\"Planned path only; no transform has been created in Minecraft.\"\n\"PATH-002\",\"S01-002; S02-001; S10-001\",\"Locked numerical camera\",\"15\",\"24\",\"MP-C (0,2.2,-10), 58-degree FOV, level, path centreline X0\",\"Identical camera; only actor and world state change\",\"MATCH PATH invariant across R4 night, R0 morning and resumed fire run.\"\n\"PATH-003\",\"S02-002\",\"Replay Mod or CinematicTools after CAM-001\",\"8\",\"24\",\"CL-C (-6,2.8,-8), facing overlook\",\"CL-C shifted 1 block camera-right with same target\",\"Restrained observational drift; static fallback acceptable.\"\n\"PATH-004\",\"S02-003\",\"Short controlled gameplay moves\",\"6\",\"24\",\"S2-A (-7,1.7,-5), three actor marks held\",\"Camera advances 1 block without crossing action line\",\"Separate actor plates may use the same path.\"\n\"PATH-005\",\"S02-005; S13-004\",\"Locked numerical camera\",\"10\",\"24\",\"MF-A (-5,2.2,-7), 52-degree FOV, fixed sun and marks\",\"Static hold followed by optional 1-block restrained follow\",\"Scene 13 must repeat the exact approved path or reuse the source plate.\"\n\"PATH-006\",\"S03-001\",\"Replay Mod, CinematicTools or controlled spectator after test\",\"12\",\"24\",\"Ravine descent upper mark, 62-degree FOV\",\"PC-D (-6,2.4,-10) facing granite seam\",\"Keep water, ledges and Moss route legible.\"\n\"PATH-007\",\"S03-002\",\"Numerical corner reveal\",\"8\",\"24\",\"PC-R start behind iron corner (-7,1.8,-8)\",\"PC-R end (-5,1.8,-7) with frame centred\",\"Portal audio starts only after the frame enters view.\"\n\"PATH-008\",\"S03-003\",\"Validated portal-capable camera tool\",\"6\",\"24\",\"PC-P (-2,1.7,-6), target frame centre\",\"PC-P (2,1.7,-6), same target and 54-degree FOV\",\"Four-block lateral parallax proof; no easing change within match plates.\"\n\"PATH-009\",\"S03-003; S04-001\",\"Validated portal camera or matched composite path\",\"5\",\"24\",\"Source mark (0,1.6,-4)\",\"Destination mark (0,1.6,4)\",\"Player/Moss crossing may use separate concealed handoff if live transfer fails.\"\n\"PATH-010\",\"S04-002\",\"Replay or controlled spectator\",\"8\",\"24\",\"R1-S (-8,3,-10), 68-degree FOV\",\"R1-S shifted 2 blocks right, target empty build footprint\",\"Physical geography must remain recognisable.\"\n\"PATH-011\",\"S04-003; S05-001; S05-003\",\"Locked numerical insert camera\",\"4\",\"24\",\"FF-C (-2.5,1,-3), 40-degree FOV, left foot centred\",\"Static end identical\",\"Used for marked R1, bare R2 and bare R3 plates.\"\n\"PATH-012\",\"S06-001\",\"Slow archive survey; exact tool pending\",\"8\",\"24\",\"AR-C (-6,2.1,-7), target storage\",\"AR-C shifted 2 blocks right, target desk symbol\",\"Do not move during readable Atlas inserts.\"\n\"PATH-013\",\"S06-003\",\"Validated portal camera or matched plates\",\"7\",\"24\",\"AR-X (-7,2,-6), blocked stair and pair visible\",\"Threshold mark at frame with camera 2 blocks closer\",\"Gravel and portal contraction may be separate layers.\"\n\"PATH-014\",\"S07-001\",\"Matched destination continuation\",\"5\",\"24\",\"R4-A crossing endpoint\",\"R4-A static look-back at collapsing mouth\",\"Soft state fade; no explosive camera shake.\"\n\"PATH-015\",\"S08-001\",\"Locked milestone camera\",\"8\",\"24\",\"HOME-EXT (-10,3,-12), 60-degree FOV\",\"Static identical endpoint\",\"Each build milestone uses the same camera, light family and footprint.\"\n\"PATH-016\",\"S08-003; S09-003\",\"Locked domestic